  | `logo` | `optional string` |  |
  | `management` | `optional string` | Tipo de gestión: public (no tuition; families pay the enrollment and the APAFA fee) \| private. Unset on an update keeps what is stored; turning public fails while open periods still have tuition in plans or owed |

